# Static, bounded stroke overlays supported by the navigation fonts; no animated corruption or stacked accents.
territory-faction-infestation = I̸nf̶e̷st̸at̶ion
exodus-iff-infested = In̷f̶es̸t̶ed
exodus-iff-territory-status = { $name } [{ $status }]

ent-ExodusChimeraCore = hive heart
    .desc = A crimson heart heaves between plates of bone. Thick veins burrow beneath the plating, and the surrounding flesh shudders with every beat. The air reeks of warm blood and raw meat.
ent-ActionGrowChimeraCore = Grow hive heart
    .desc = Root a living heart in a station free of another's banner. Remain still while the flesh binds to the chosen patch of floor: a sudden movement or wound will interrupt its growth.

exodus-hive-grow-no-territory = This place cannot sustain the heart's roots.
exodus-hive-grow-claimed = A banner already stands here, or another heart beats beneath the plating. Remove it first.
exodus-hive-grow-blocked = Choose a clear patch of floor within reach.
exodus-hive-grow-failed = The flesh recoils from the plating. The heart has failed to take root.
exodus-hive-core-inactive = The heart has gone slack. Its vessels no longer nourish the surrounding flesh.
exodus-hive-core-next = The beginnings of new life stir beneath the wet membrane. Thick fluid pulses steadily through the veins.
exodus-hive-core-no-surface = Swollen vessels reach across the plating, finding no unoccupied living tissue from which a new creature could emerge.
